sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Provider
  participant A as AMI Adapter
  participant C as Canonical Store
  participant F as Feature Builder
  participant S as Strategy/Models
  participant X as Evidence Fusion
  participant R as AMI Risk
  participant O as Paper OMS
  participant L as Ledger
  P->>A: Source event + source timestamp
  A->>A: Validate transport, identity and precision
  A->>C: Canonical event + provenance
  C->>C: Freshness, sequence, gap and contract checks
  C->>F: Causal snapshot
  F->>S: Versioned feature snapshot
  S->>X: Forecasts and strategy evidence
  X->>X: Validate lineage, calibration and conflicts
  X->>R: Decision proposal or NO_TRADE
  R->>R: Independent limits / exposure / cost gate
  alt Paper authorization passes
    R->>O: Paper-only authorization
    O->>L: Simulated order/fill/position events
  else Rejected / stale / unknown
    R->>L: Veto and reason event
  end
